          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cg4drwzkrkxo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "cluster_id": 4,
          "text": "Italian Prime Minister Giorgia Meloni called for Spain to be suspended from the Schengen zone following the migrant influx in Ceuta.",
